# rust_target.c / rust/buggy_target's magic prefix + selector bytes.
# The whole "RUST" + selector comparison compiles to a single inlined
# check in release mode -- coverage feedback alone has no intermediate
# edge to reward getting 1-of-4 magic bytes right, so pure mutation
# stalls before ever trying the exact sequence. These tokens give the
# dictionary-based mutation operators the exact bytes to splice in.
"RUSTS"
"RUSTO"
"RUSTW"
"RUSTP"
